<h2>Frontends</h2>

<p>
  SmartCGMS is a set of libraries, which are by-default runtime-loaded, dynamic ones. For special purposes and with an appropriate commerical license, these can be static to satisfy all embedded-device needs. Due to the library-nature of the SmartCGMS, we provide front-ends 
  to easy work with the {doclink('sdk','configuration','configuration')|noescape}, {doclink('sdk','execution','execution')|noescape} and {doclink('sdk','optimizer','optimization')|noescape}.
</p>

<p>
  As a front-end to the SmartCGMS libraries, you can use either the {doclink('tools','console','console')|noescape} or {doclink('tools','gui','GUI')|noescape} application to execute it. The console application is intended for batch processing, to execute the experimental setups with no user input while conserving system resources.
</p>